      36.0,
      345.03,
      561.92,
      392.25
    ],
    "text": "The Cyclonic Storm \u201cAkvan\u201d has made landfall in India and it is expected to continue moved move nearly north-northeastwards and weaken into a Deep Depression during next 03 hours and into a Depression during subsequent 06 hours.",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.520000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      403.56,
      561.81,
      448.66
    ],
    "text": "Wind speeds in the sea areas marked in the map below, may increase to (60-65) kmph at times, heavy thundershowers can occur, and these sea areas will become rough to very rough. The fishing and Naval communities are requested to remain vigilant regarding this situation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
